WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.393
A shopper asks an AI for a sofa.

2
00:00:02.393 --> 00:00:03.665
It can't see yours.

3
00:00:03.665 --> 00:00:06.210
It reads your page, and finds nothing.

4
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.030
AgentShelf makes your products legible.

5
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:15.893
We pull every fact an AI compares on from your pages, each one quoted in your own words.

6
00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:18.819
A claim that isn't on the page gets dropped.

7
00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:23.940
Your team approves the rest, and we publish it where Google and ChatGPT look.

8
00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.660
Now when shoppers ask, your sofa is in the answer, with its sources.

9
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.213
That's AgentShelf.

10
00:00:34.213 --> 00:00:35.765
Proof behind every fact.

11
00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:37.510
Ask for your free snapshot.
